OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPeople should feel able to give
OL,4,ACPR, survivor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who received life-saving help
OL,7,Ffrom bystanders when she suffered a
OL,8,Fcardiac arrest at Gatwick Airport is
OL,9,Fencouraging others to feel confident
OL,10,Fgiving CPR.
OL,12,FRetired teacher Helen Warren, from
OL,13,FLondon, collapsed when walking to her
OL,14,Fdeparture gate in September 2025,
OL,15,Fprompting two other passengers to begin
OL,16,Fresuscitation.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
