OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPeople should feel able to give
OL,4,ACPR, survivor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAir Ambulance Charity Kent Surrey
OL,7,FSussex (KSS), which airlifted the
OL,8,F68-year-old to hospital, said it was
OL,9,Fconcerned some people might hesitate
OL,10,Fbefore touching a woman's chest or
OL,11,Fclothing to perform CPR.
OL,13,FWarren said: "Without the people who
OL,14,Fstepped in to help me that day, I
OL,15,Fwouldn't be here."
